msgid "DroneCAN ESCs"
msgstr "DroneCAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:7 602b38d0f2d44553b1541ac23b0df218
msgid ""
"Copter, Plane and Rover support `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ "
"Electronic Speed Controllers (ESCs) that allow two-way communication with "
"the autopilot enabling potentially easier setup and in-flight monitoring of "
"ESC and motor health."
msgstr ""
"Copter、Plane 和 Rover 支持 `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ "
"电子调速器（ESC），可与飞控进行双向通信，从而更轻松地完成设置并在飞行中监控 ESC 和电机健康状态。"

