#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:30
#: de7d4d988c4249c1bbde0d403fdc89fa
msgid "Connecting to the Flight Controller"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:35
#: b654ffcf00a2456797ac624ce9a9016f
msgid ""
"One ESC (it does not matter which) should be connected to the autopilot's "
"CAN port using a 4-pin DF13 to 4-pin DroneCAN adapter cable. Each subsequent"
" ESC should be connected to the previous using a 4-pin DroneCAN cable.  The "
"final ESC should have a CAN bus terminator plugged into one of its 4-pin "
"DroneCAN ports."
msgstr ""
"任意一个 ESC（顺序无关）应使用 4 针 DF13 转 4 针 DroneCAN 适配线缆连接到飞控的 CAN 端口。每个后续 ESC 应使用 4 针"
" DroneCAN 线缆连接到前一个 ESC。最后一个 ESC 的某个 4 针 DroneCAN 端口应插上 CAN 总线终端电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:41
#: abb0425a58644085ba4933e21b4b2f25
msgid ""
"An FTDI Cable connection to the ESC's debug port is only required for set-up"
" if the ESC does not present its parameters via DroneCAN. In that case, "
"contact the manufacturer for detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"仅当 ESC 不通过 DroneCAN 提供参数时，才需要将 FTDI 线连接到 ESC 的调试端口进行设置。在这种情况下，请联系制造商获取详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:43
#: b867dc3530704a3a9c3c72870d21ee7a
msgid ""
"Preferably, the ESC can be configured via CAN bus using the :ref:`DroneCAN "
"GUI Tool <common-uavcan-gui>`."
msgstr "最好通过 CAN 总线使用 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI Tool <common-uavcan-gui>` 配置 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:46
#: 08503aee99ff4e0fbe2c47f49dc95cdd
msgid "Autopilot Setup"
msgstr "飞控设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:48
#: f81074d6296f4371b33a810f7d90ab28
msgid ""
"There are several parameters that determine which autopilot servo/motor "
"channels are sent to the DroneCAN ESCs: For the examples below, the values "
"are shown for DroneCAN driver #1 using CAN Port #1"
msgstr ""
"有几个参数决定哪些飞控舵机/电机通道被发送到 DroneCAN ESC：以下示例的值适用于使用 CAN 端口 #1 的 DroneCAN 驱动 #1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:51
#: f9bd40cc5be84861a61c7b98413d922e
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1, which assigns driver1 to port1"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1，将驱动 1 分配到端口 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:52
#: e05e7733b1c64ef082ec8f216a497504
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN protocol)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（DroneCAN 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:53
#: 264991a58d484a3fab9a8e517a81d0c9
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NODE<CAN_D1_UC_NODE>` - which is the node ID of the "
"autopilot sending the commands to the ESCs so that there can be "
"differentiation between multiple sources on the CAN bus. This is normally "
"automatically set during discovery, but can be altered for advanced "
"configurations (multiple sources on the bus)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NODE<CAN_D1_UC_NODE>` - 这是飞控发送命令给 ESC 的节点 ID，用于区分 CAN "
"总线上的多个来源。通常在发现过程中自动设置，但可以针对高级配置（总线上的多个来源）进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:54
#: b88d5f6508c74d119c6505db05c1a413
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` - bitmask that determines which "
"autopilot servo/motor output signals are sent to the DroneCAN ESCSs"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` - 位掩码，决定哪些飞控舵机/电机输出信号被发送到 DroneCAN"
" ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:55
#: 0aacfab240e54ee7bbf5bd6c05afc8a0
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV>` - bitmask that designates which "
"autopilot servo/motor outputs have reversible DroneCAN ESCs, allowing both "
"positive and negative control values to be sent."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_RV>` - 位掩码，指定哪些飞控舵机/电机输出具有可反转的 DroneCAN"
" ESC，允许发送正负控制值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-escs.rst:58
